    .prod-text
      .prod-text_title.title-3  Our offer
      .prod-text_body
        p We can help to create your personal product from all raw materials which we have in our assortment.
          | Product can be created with our technical food specialist or by yours. We have 15-20 different kind 
          | of packing bottles which you can choose and after make your private label on in with us. We guarantee 
          | a best quality raw materials which we import from Europe and some part from Asia. Quality control, 
          | we make for each supply. All production we made on high quality new machines (ISO standard) with CE mark.
        p If you want to have your own product on Food supplement market, we are a good and reliable partner for it. 
          | More then 200 raw material components: minerals, extract's, vitamins, adaptogens, amino acids, probiotics 
          | and much more. For more questions, regarding the price and min. quantities, please free to contact us, 
          | that we can calculate a price per product and give the best terms. We invite to cooperation all 
          | interested parties.